<BaseLayout title="Our Story & Ministry Heart | Healing the Heart">
<section class="page-hero"><div class="page-hero-inner"><p class="eyebrow">The heart behind the ministry</p><h1>Healed people help bring healing to others.</h1><p>Healing the Heart exists because people were never meant to spend their entire lives simply managing their pain.</p></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="rich-section"><h2>A place to be honest.</h2><p>Healing the Heart is a deeply compassionate, Christ-centred healing ministry built around the Healing &amp; Restoring the Heart curriculum.</p><p>This is not simply a course, counselling service, self-help program, or collection of information. It is a safe, Spirit-led healing journey where people can honestly face the pain and wounds of their past, recognize how those experiences have shaped their present lives, expose the lies they have believed, and allow Jesus to bring truth, healing, restoration, and freedom.</p><h2 style="margin-top:4rem">Why Jesus is at the centre.</h2><p>Our model of a safe place is seen in the way Jesus interacted with hurting people, especially the woman at the well in John 4. He approached her without condemnation, showed compassion while still speaking truth, and touched the deeper pain of her story.</p><p>We want this website—and the ministry behind it—to carry that same posture: truth without shame, compassion without pretending, and hope without pressure.</p></div></section>
<section class="statement-band"><p>Jesus is not frightened by your pain.</p></section>
</BaseLayout>
